# Improving the Lives of Our Miloliʻi ʻOhana

Paʻa Pono Miloliʻi strives to preserve and protect the cultural, historical, environmental, and archaeological life and
heritage within the ahupuaʻa of Hoʻokena, Pāpā, Hoʻōpūloa, Miloliʻi, Omokaʻa, Kalihi, Honomalino, Okoe, and Kapuʻa.
        <primary-button href="about/core-values">Our Story</primary-button>    
    </template>
</banner>
